# SearXNG local config (deployment-specific, per m00119 + m00125).
#   - settings.yml is bind-mounted into the SearXNG container at /etc/searxng
#     (compose/compose.sensor.yml). It MUST be deployment-specific because
#     the SearXNG entrypoint rewrites `secret_key` on every restart from
#     $SEARXNG_SECRET (set in compose/.env). If we tracked this file,
#     `git pull` (via scripts/update.sh) would overwrite production's local
#     value with the repo template — which violates the
#     "production server config not overwritten by updates" policy.
#   - settings.yml.template is the canonical template committed for fresh
#     installs (install.sh step_secrets bootstraps settings.yml from it).
#   - Logs/ are SearXNG container logs bind-mounted for ops access.
config/searxng/settings.yml
config/searxng/logs/
